# build outputs
**/target
target-ci-local
_build
deps
priv/native/*.so
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
.elixir_ls
cover
flezha-*.tar

# runtime / scratch
app_data
logs
*.dump
erl_crash.dump
bench-*.txt
BENCH.md
QUIC_DIAGNOSTICS.md
